ve to seal the lid and a perforated tear strip for easy opening.","slug":"mailer-box-with-adhesive","productId":"mb-ad","moqStandard":null,"moqCustom":100,"label":"","jsonSchema":null,"additionalNotes":"optional","sortOrder":40,"internalUseOnly":false,"priceControl":"A","extendedDescription":"The mailer box with adhesive is a durable corrugated option perfect for those looking to streamline their packaging process. Just like our standard mailer box, it has dust flaps and ear locks, allowing for a secure closure. The added adhesive strip makes for efficient packaging while the perforated tear strip makes for a trouble-free unboxing experience for customers. \n\nThese boxes are shipped flat, allowing for lower delivery costs and less storage space required. Similar to other mailer boxes, they are reliable and versatile across a wide range of products from cosmetics to electronics. Finished with a tear strip, it's guaranteed to provide your customers peace of mind that their packages have not been tampered with.","essentials":true,"dimensionSizeTypeOptions":"innerOuter","createdAt":"2021-06-03T12:22:41.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-14T02:29:40.628Z","image":{"id":943,"name":"packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","alternativeText":"PackMojo Mailer Box with Adhesive","caption":"","width":1080,"height":1080,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":156,"height":156,"size":24.03,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png"},"large":{"name":"large_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"large_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":1000,"height":1000,