. PackMojo is a fantastic brand that offers high-quality service and boxes and we couldn't be more grateful for what they have done for us so far! Definitely looking to return for more boxes for sure!","author":"My Athlete Box","authorPosition":null,"authorLink":null,"rating":5,"linkTitle":"Read more about My Athlete Boxes journey","linkUrl":"/showcase/mailer-boxes/my-athlete-box/","createdAt":"2021-04-21T07:10:19.000Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-17T07:23:19.000Z","locale":"en","featureImage":{"id":46,"name":"my-athlete-box-custom-subscription-box-packaging.jpg","alternativeText":"My Athlete Box Subscription Box Packaging","caption":"","width":984,"height":738,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_my-athlete-box-custom-subscription-box-packaging.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":208,"height":156,"size":7.96,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916.jpg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_my-athlete-box-custom-subscription-box-packaging.jpg","hash":"medium_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":750,"height":563,"size":76.62,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916.jpg"},"small":{"name":"small_my-athlete-box-custom-subscription-box-packaging.jpg","hash":"small_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":375,"size":38.03,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916.jpg"}},"hash":"my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":123.45,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/my_athlete_box_custom_subscription_box_packaging_5ca6a3a916.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2021-04-14T01:30:37.000Z","updatedAt":"2021-04-14T01:30:37.000Z","focalPoint":null},"product_category":{"id":1,"categoryId":"mailer-boxes","name":"Mailer Boxes","singularName":"Mailer Box","description":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","moqCustom":"100","moqStandard":"30","sortOrder":"1","type":"packaging","showcaseTitle":"Explore Mailer Boxes","showcaseDescription":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","createdAt":"2021-04-07T03:21:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-04-07T02:14:50.000Z"}},{"id":4,"content":"You guys rocked! You made it super simple for us to get started and the results look amazing! Thank you to Wendy who gave us valuable advice on all the different options which would best suit our business and brand when it came to our packaging. We were able to reach our launch timeline and had great feedback from our customers!","author":"Beams Collective","authorPosition":null,"authorLink":null,"rating":5,"linkTitle":"Read more about Beams Collective’s journey","linkUrl":"/showcase/mailer-boxes/beams/","createdAt":"2021-04-26T05:50:41.000Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-06T04:07:06.000Z","locale":"en","featureImage":{"id":30,"name":"beams-coffee-custom-packaging-box-coffee-pods.jpg","alternativeText":"BEAMS Coffee Custom Packaging Box for Coffee Pods","caption":"","width":1000,"height":1000,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_beams-coffee-custom-packaging-box-coffee-pods.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":156,"height":156,"size":5.52,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb.jpg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_beams-coffee-custom-packaging-box-coffee-pods.jpg","hash":"medium_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":750,"height":750,"size":69.98,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb.jpg"},"small":{"name":"small_beams-coffee-custom-packaging-box-coffee-pods.jpg","hash":"small_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":500,"size":34.63,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb.jpg"}},"hash":"beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":115.44,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/beams_coffee_custom_packaging_box_coffee_pods_4d0f33a6fb.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2021-04-12T12:43:14.000Z","updatedAt":"2021-04-12T12:43:14.000Z","focalPoint":null},"product_category":{"id":1,"categoryId":"mailer-boxes","name":"Mailer Boxes","singularName":"Mailer Box","description":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","moqCustom":"100","moqStandard":"30","sortOrder":"1","type":"packaging","showcaseTitle":"Explore Mailer Boxes","showcaseDescription":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","createdAt":"2021-04-07T03:21:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-04-07T02:14:50.000Z"}},{"id":35,"content":"We are huge fans of the PackMojo team. We've been happy customers for over a year now and are delighted with how our products turn out and how quickly they arrive. Their customer service is so responsive and can't be beat. Special shout-out to Vincent Choi who takes such good care of us. Highly recommend!","author":"Ello","authorPosition":null,"authorLink":null,"rating":5,"linkTitle":"Read more about Ello’s journey","linkUrl":"/showcase/mailer-boxes/ello/","createdAt":"2023-05-08T03:36:46.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-01-31T05:39:27.354Z","locale":"en","featureImage":{"id":1035,"name":"ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes.jpeg","alternativeText":"Ello Custom Printed Mailer Boxes","caption":"","width":2016,"height":1512,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes.jpeg","hash":"thumbnail_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":208,"height":156,"size":16.76,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed.jpeg"},"large":{"name":"large_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes.jpeg","hash":"large_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":1000,"height":750,"size":118.31,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed.jpeg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes.jpeg","hash":"medium_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":750,"height":563,"size":79,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed.jpeg"},"small":{"name":"small_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes.jpeg","hash":"small_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","width":500,"height":375,"size":45.08,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed.jpeg"}},"hash":"ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed","ext":".jpeg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":335.99,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/ello_custom_printed_mailer_boxes_e50f1316ed.jpeg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3-webp","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2023-05-09T01:46:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2024-06-08T01:46:42.000Z","focalPoint":null},"product_category":{"id":1,"categoryId":"mailer-boxes","name":"Mailer Boxes","singularName":"Mailer Box","description":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","moqCustom":"100","moqStandard":"30","sortOrder":"1","type":"packaging","showcaseTitle":"Explore Mailer Boxes","showcaseDescription":"Mailer boxes are the perfect box for eCommerce packaging and shipping. They can be shipped as is and are fully customizable with print inside and out.","createdAt":"2021-04-07T03:21:27.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-04-07T02:14:50.000Z"}}],"__component":"sections.reviews"},{"id":2043,"title":"Scaling your monthly orders?","subTitle":"If you're managing consistent monthly inventory, you can easily set up split shipments, get dedicated account support, and request custom volume pricing directly through our platform - starting at 100 units for mailer boxes.","content":null,"backgroundColor":"white","textColor":"default","backgroundImageOverlayAmount":0.7,"parallaxAmount":0.6,"contentAlignment":"start","secondaryContent":false,"size":"standard","imageCssOverride":null,"navigationTitle":null,"actions":[{"id":2769,"title":"Customize your specs and request a quote","link":"https://app.packmojo.com/","type":"continue_to_platform_modal","external":false}],"backgroundImage":null,"featureImage":null,"__component":"sections.single-column"},{"id":114,"title":"Mailer box order process","subTitle":"A single platform to get quotes and place orders, with dedicated support every step of the way.","layout":"horizontal","showConnectors":true,"showNumbers":true,"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"light","size":"standard","contentAlignment":"center","navigationTitle":null,"steps":[{"id":557,"title":"Customize your packaging","content":"Go to the [PackMojo platform](/platform/) to customize the size, materials, print, and finishes of your mailer boxes.","icon":null},{"id":558,"title":"Get quotes \u0026 samples","content":"Compare packaging quotes and get a [sample](/samples/) of your mailer box before starting a production order.","icon":null},{"id":559,"title":"Select shipping methods","content":"Choose a preferred shipping method and even set up split shipments to get some packaging delivered quicker.","icon":null},{"id":560,"title":"Upload artwork","content":"Add your artwork to the [dieline](/help/what-is-a-dieline/) template that we tailor make to your box specifications.","icon":null},{"id":561,"title":"Track order progress","content":"Get full visibility on the progress of samples, production, and shipping.","icon":null}],"__component":"sections.steps"},{"id":6,"title":"Technical Specs: Mailer Boxes","navigationTitle":"Technical specs","content":"An overview of the standard customizations available for corrugated mailer boxes.","backgroundColor":"white","textColor":"default","size":"standard","entries":[{"id":25,"title":"Corrugation","description":"[Corrugation](https://packmojo.com/help/what-is-flute-in-packaging/), also known as flute, is used to strengthen the cardboard used in your packaging. They typically look like wavy lines which when glued to a paperboard, forms the corrugated board.","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"waves","options":[{"id":66,"title":"E-fute","description":"Most common choice. Flute thickness of 1.2–2mm."},{"id":67,"title":"B-flute","description":"Best for large boxes and heavy items. Flute thickness of 2.5–3mm."}]},{"id":26,"title":"Materials","description":"Designs are printed on these base materials which is then glued to the corrugated board. All materials contain at least 50% post-consumer content (recycled materials).","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"layers","options":[{"id":68,"title":"White","description":"Clay Coated News Back (CCNB) paper. Ideal for vibrant, full-color printing."},{"id":69,"title":"Brown Kraft","description":"Unbleached brown paper. Best suited for simple black or white designs."}]},{"id":27,"title":"Color systems","description":"All packaging is printed with soy-based ink, which is eco-friendly and produces much brighter and vibrant colors.\n\n[Compare CMYK \u0026 Pantone](/help/rgb-cmyk-pms/)","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"palette","options":[{"id":70,"title":"CMYK","description":"Cost-effective, standard full-color printing system."},{"id":71,"title":"Pantone","description":"Premium color system used for exact brand color matching."}]},{"id":28,"title":"Coating","description":"Coating is added to your printed designs to protect it from scratches and scuffs.\n\n[Compare varnish \u0026 lamination ](/help/varnish-vs-lamination/)","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"brush","options":[{"id":72,"title":"Varnish","description":"An eco-friendly, water-based protective layer."},{"id":73,"title":"Lamination","description":"A plastic layer that protects against scuffs, cracks, and tears."}]},{"id":29,"title":"Finishes","description":"Top off your packaging with a finish option that completes your package.\n\n[Compare finishes](/help/matte-vs-glossy-finish/)","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"sparkles","options":[{"id":74,"title":"Matte","description":"Smooth, non-reflective, softer look."},{"id":75,"title":"Glossy","description":"High-shine reflective finish."},{"id":76,"title":"Satin","description":"Semi-shiny blend between matte and glossy."},{"id":77,"title":"Soft touch","description":"Premium matte look with a velvet-like texture."}]},{"id":30,"title":"Add-ons","description":"Enhance your packaging designs with specialized printing treatments and accents.","linkLabel":null,"linkHref":null,"icon":"star","options":[{"id":78,"title":"Foil stamping","description":"Metallic or colored foil layer applied with heat for a reflective shine."},{"id":79,"title":"Spot UV","description":"Glossy coating applied to specific areas for high-contrast texture."}]}],"__component":"sections.technical-specs"},{"id":1774,"title":"Looking to try a sample first?","content":"Get your hands on a selection of our most popular boxes and packaging with a reimbursable sample kit.","imagePosition":"right","imageDirection":"column","textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"primary_light","size":"large","imagesExpandable":false,"imageColumnSize":3,"imagesBeforeTextOnMobile":false,"imageCssOverride":null,"forceHighQuality":false,"navigationTitle":"Samples","subTitle":null,"actions":[{"id":2772,"title":"Get a sample kit","link":"/samples/sample-kit/","type":"primary","external":false}],"images":[{"id":2105,"name":"packmojo-sample-kit-2026-001-core-kit.jpg","alternativeText":"PackMojo Sample Kit 2026 Core Kit","caption":null,"width":1600,"height":1067,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_packmojo-sample-kit-2026-001-core-kit.jpg","hash":"thumbnail_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","path":null,"width":235,"height":156,"size":5.26,"sizeInBytes":5258,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07.jpg"},"small":{"name":"small_packmojo-sample-kit-2026-001-core-kit.jpg","hash":"small_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","path":null,"width":500,"height":333,"size":15.12,"sizeInBytes":15118,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07.jpg"},"large":{"name":"large_packmojo-sample-kit-2026-001-core-kit.jpg","hash":"large_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","path":null,"width":1000,"height":667,"size":43.49,"sizeInBytes":43487,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07.jpg"},"medium":{"name":"medium_packmojo-sample-kit-2026-001-core-kit.jpg","hash":"medium_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","path":null,"width":750,"height":500,"size":28.14,"sizeInBytes":28136,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07.jpg"}},"hash":"packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07","ext":".jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":463.12,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/packmojo_sample_kit_2026_001_core_kit_d49e1e9d07.jpg","previewUrl":null,"provider":"strapi-provider-upload-aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-18T05:48:35.420Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-02T03:14:33.504Z","focalPoint":null}],"items":[],"__component":"sections.images"},{"id":164,"title":"Video: How to fold a mailer box","content":"Our mailer boxes ship completely flat to minimize freight costs and storage space. Watch how easily they can be assembled in just a few seconds.","videoPosition":"right","videoColumnSize":6,"videoBeforeTextOnMobile":false,"textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"white","size":"standard","videoCssOverride":"image rounded","navigationTitle":"Folding guide","actions":[],"video":{"id":7,"title":"How To Fold A Mailer Box","link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LHZN0tBUM1I","createdAt":"2023-08-16T04:47:09.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-08-16T04:54:31.000Z","previewImage":{"id":1259,"name":"packmojo--how-to-fold-a-mailer-box-thumb-01.png","alternativeText":"How to fold a mailer box","caption":"","width":1920,"height":1080,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_packmojo--how-to-fold-a-mailer-box-thumb-01.png","hash":"thumbnail_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":245,"height":138,"size":28.3,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269.png"},"large":{"name":"large_packmojo--how-to-fold-a-mailer-box-thumb-01.png","hash":"large_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":1000,"height":563,"size":426.9,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269.png"},"medium":{"name":"medium_packmojo--how-to-fold-a-mailer-box-thumb-01.png","hash":"medium_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":750,"height":422,"size":232,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269.png"},"small":{"name":"small_packmojo--how-to-fold-a-mailer-box-thumb-01.png","hash":"small_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":500,"height":281,"size":101.98,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269.png"}},"hash":"packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":1254.96,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/packmojo_how_to_fold_a_mailer_box_thumb_01_91d2e92269.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3-webp","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2023-08-16T04:46:53.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-08-16T04:46:53.000Z","focalPoint":null}},"__component":"sections.featured-video"},{"id":187,"title":"Frequently Asked Questions","subTitle":"Can't find what you're looking for? Check out our [help center](/help/).","textColor":"default","backgroundColor":"white","size":"standard","navigationTitle":"FAQs","rightColumnHelpEntries":[{"id":1505,"entry":{"id":754,"type":"faq","title":"Can PackMojo handle bulk production and recurring monthly shipments for eCommerce?","content":"Yes, PackMojo supports growing eCommerce brands shipping hundreds of monthly orders through bulk production runs, volume-based pricing tiers, split shipments, and dedicated account support. You can set up split shipments to multiple locations, access dedicated support, and request custom volume pricing directly through our platform starting at just 100 units.","keywords":null,"featured":false,"createdAt":"2026-06-17T05:54:56.406Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-12T07:06:02.501Z","page":null}},{"id":1506,"entry":{"id":726,"type":"faq","title":"Can I purchase a sample before placing an order?","content":"Absolutely. We offer several different sample types depending on what you need to test. Whether you just want to verify the physical size and fit of your packaging or need to check final colors and printed artwork, we've got you covered. [You can explore all of our sample options here](/samples/).","keywords":"proof, press proof","featured":true,"createdAt":"2021-04-28T12:06:41.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:10:18.224Z","page":null}},{"id":1507,"entry":{"id":729,"type":"faq","title":"Can you provide me with a dieline template?","content":"Yes, we provide custom dieline templates after you place an order for either a custom sample or a full production run.","keywords":null,"featured":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-28T12:21:11.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:12:37.786Z","page":null}},{"id":1508,"entry":{"id":728,"type":"faq","title":"What format should I provide my artwork to you in?","content":"Please submit your artwork using the custom dieline template we provide, ideally in an editable PDF or Adobe Illustrator (AI) format. To ensure your file is production-ready, keep the design on a separate artwork layer and review our [dieline design guide](/dieline-design-tips/) before uploading.","keywords":null,"featured":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-28T12:19:29.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:12:00.589Z","page":null}}],"leftColumnHelpEntries":[{"id":1501,"entry":{"id":721,"type":"faq","title":"What is the minimum order quantity for custom mailer boxes?","content":"The minimum order quantity for custom mailer boxes is 100 units. This MOQ applies to each unique box variation, meaning any change in size, material, or printed artwork counts as a separate production run of 100 boxes.","keywords":null,"featured":false,"createdAt":"2021-06-03T08:14:43.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T05:58:36.652Z","page":{"id":350,"navigationTitle":"MOQ","slug":"what-is-your-moq","jsonSchema":null,"createdAt":"2021-04-27T07:11:48.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-11T02:53:42.641Z","onPageNavigation":"none"}}},{"id":1502,"entry":{"id":722,"type":"faq","title":"Where is your packaging produced?","content":"We manufacture all of our packaging through a vetted network of trusted production partners in China, and ship everything directly from the factory to your doorstep.","keywords":"factory, location, based, ship from","featured":true,"createdAt":"2021-04-28T12:10:17.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:00:39.813Z","page":null}},{"id":1503,"entry":{"id":730,"type":"faq","title":"What are your lead times?","content":"Our standard production lead times typically take 12-16 days, though larger bulk orders can take 3-4 weeks depending on the overall volume and complexity of your packaging. Total delivery timelines will vary based on the shipping method you select.","keywords":"lead time, turnaround, production time","featured":true,"createdAt":"2021-04-27T06:31:40.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:14:09.594Z","page":{"id":344,"navigationTitle":"Lead time","slug":"what-is-your-lead-time","jsonSchema":null,"createdAt":"2021-05-03T09:50:57.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-07T04:50:03.144Z","onPageNavigation":"none"}}},{"id":1504,"entry":{"id":724,"type":"faq","title":"How long does shipping take?","content":"Shipping times depend entirely on the transport method you choose for your packaging. Air freight generally takes 1-3 weeks, while ocean freight ranges from 4-8 weeks. If you are on a tight deadline, you can split your shipment to send an initial batch via air and the remainder by sea.","keywords":null,"featured":false,"createdAt":"2021-04-28T12:10:48.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-17T06:03:08.156Z","page":null}}],"__component":"sections.fa-qs"},{"id":23,"title":"Got any other questions? Ask ChatMojo","subTitle":"ChatMojo is our AI powered assistant to help you on your packaging journey","placeholder":"Ask about our packaging products...","pageType":"product-focus","backgroundColor":"white","textColor":"default","size":"standard","contentAlignment":"center","navigationTitle":null,"products":[{"id":3,"title":"Mailer Box with Adhesive","description":"Corrugated mailer boxes with cherry locks and dust flaps. It includes an adhesive to seal the lid and a perforated tear strip for easy opening.","slug":"mailer-box-with-adhesive","productId":"mb-ad","moqStandard":null,"moqCustom":100,"label":"","jsonSchema":null,"additionalNotes":"optional","sortOrder":40,"internalUseOnly":false,"priceControl":"A","extendedDescription":"The mailer box with adhesive is a durable corrugated option perfect for those looking to streamline their packaging process. Just like our standard mailer box, it has dust flaps and ear locks, allowing for a secure closure. The added adhesive strip makes for efficient packaging while the perforated tear strip makes for a trouble-free unboxing experience for customers. \n\nThese boxes are shipped flat, allowing for lower delivery costs and less storage space required. Similar to other mailer boxes, they are reliable and versatile across a wide range of products from cosmetics to electronics. Finished with a tear strip, it's guaranteed to provide your customers peace of mind that their packages have not been tampered with.","essentials":true,"dimensionSizeTypeOptions":"innerOuter","createdAt":"2021-06-03T12:22:41.000Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-14T02:29:40.628Z","image":{"id":943,"name":"packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","alternativeText":"PackMojo Mailer Box with Adhesive","caption":"","width":1080,"height":1080,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":156,"height":156,"size":24.03,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png"},"large":{"name":"large_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"large_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":1000,"height":1000,"size":665.18,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/large_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png"},"medium":{"name":"medium_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"medium_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":750,"height":750,"size":373.28,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/medium_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png"},"small":{"name":"small_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--product-catalogue-01.png","hash":"small_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":500,"height":500,"size":170.41,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/small_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png"}},"hash":"packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","size":597.56,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_product_catalogue_01_9e2e99d5b3.png","previewUrl":null,"provider":"aws-s3","provider_metadata":null,"createdAt":"2023-02-04T04:21:42.000Z","updatedAt":"2023-02-04T04:21:42.000Z","focalPoint":null},"standardImages":[{"id":1123,"name":"packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--standard-views-01.png","alternativeText":"PackMojo Mailer Box with Adhesive","caption":"","width":1080,"height":1080,"formats":{"thumbnail":{"name":"thumbnail_packmojo--mb-ad--mailer-box-with-adhesive--standard-views-01.png","hash":"thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_with_adhesive_standard_views_01_48e956b291","ext":".png","mime":"image/png","width":156,"height":156,"size":11.89,"path":null,"url":"https://packmojo.com/cms_assets/thumbnail_packmojo_mb_ad_mailer_box_